project/PROGRESS.md:224:- GPT discussion (discuss/b8-old-pages.md): outer-screen store = bag's film drawer; tap roll → info card pulled out (big drag-compare sample, try-with-my-photo + save); settings = maintenance kit (3 physical switches, booklet with tabs, long text full-sheet ≥17pt); restore/redeem on the certificate.
project/PROGRESS.md:228:- Reviewing the last picture: format key → SHARE (face + printed name), makes ComparisonVideo from a kept 1350px before/after pair, share sheet via SwiftUI sheet (works in the capture extension too). Codex: pair now also kept when Photos denied; temp mp4 removed on dismiss; key name switches. Not tested on device (needs a real shot).
project/PROGRESS.md:312:- Discussed with GPT (project/discuss/spreads.md): pairs of pages behind big index tabs on the bag's right edge (films → kit → club later); the kit uses both pages (left: switch plate + certificate; right: handbook + bookmarks + nameplate).
project/PROGRESS.md:584:- 看板加：kit-switches-v3、lockscreen-flat-2（解释情形）、book-vs-club-2（v1 带小册、社区下一版的理由）、asc-go。
project/reviews/outer-bag.md:3:- `cameragr/Camera/CameraModel.swift:409–412`：外屏包打开时，音量键／Camera Control 仍能触发拍照，并提前装入待选胶卷、消耗试拍次数。当前只拦截 `.flat`，没有检查 `bag`。在 `loadChosenRollNow()` 前增加 `guard bag == nil else { return }`，保证扣包前不会因快门误装、误拍。
project/reviews/P2-switch-r1.md:12:- `project/BLUEPRINT.md` 未找到名为 **P2-switch** 的任务或独立验收标准；最接近的是 1.2 性能目标和 QUEUE 末尾测速待办，需补齐任务映射。
project/reviews/widgets-accept.md:3:- `cameragr/Camera/CameraModel.swift:363–368`：小组件跳转只关闭相机包，没有清除 `readyToLoad`、`arrivingRoll` 和 `arrivalID`。复现：包里选 A → 返回桌面点小组件 B → 拍照；`:438` 的 `loadChosenRollNow()` 会重新装 A，导致实际使用错误胶卷；已有装卷定时回调也可能覆盖 B。修复：有效跳转时取消待装卷及装卷动画状态，再加载目标卷，并补回归测试。

